{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>Only</b> — And I had no savior besides Him. And because he mentioned above, \"from Him is my salvation,\" therefore he mentioned here, \"He is my salvation.\"" "<b>I shall not be greatly moved</b> — The meaning of לא אמוט is: \"I shall not be moved.\"" "<b>Greatly</b> — The opposite of \"my stronghold,\" for we find תהום in the feminine: תהום רוממתהו (it raised him up)."], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 62, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:32:28.617991238Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}